Package: xsmut
Title: Cross-Species Comparison of Somatic Mutations Against Human COSMIC
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Checks genes against the COSMIC Cancer Gene Census, retrieves human
    COSMIC mutations for a gene, maps mutations annotated in any Ensembl species
    (e.g. macaque, Mmul_10) onto human reference coordinates via ortholog protein
    alignment, and draws a gene-model plot with the user's species mutations and
    human COSMIC mutations in opposite panels, optionally highlighting matches to
    the top COSMIC hotspots. Includes a Shiny app.
